      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait lol goblins? i'm pretty sure it's just a broken part, not actual creatures in my water tank. but seriously, the tapping is getting faster. it's like a steady drumbeat now. is there any mechanical reason why a noise would actually pick up speed like that?",
